# Tutankhamun's family as determined by Hawass Z et al. (2010) JAMA 303(7): 638,
# doi:10.1001/jama.2010.121, Figure 2. KV55 (most probably Akhenaten) and KV35YL are
# full siblings, children of Amenhotep III and Tiye (KV35EL), and the parents of
# Tutankhamun. KV21A as the mother of the two fetuses from KV62 is the paper's
# tentative assignment. PHENO is left missing (0): this is a consanguinity example.
TUT	Yuya	0	0	1	0
TUT	Thuya	0	0	2	0
TUT	Amenhotep_III	0	0	1	0
TUT	Tiye	Yuya	Thuya	2	0
TUT	KV55	Amenhotep_III	Tiye	1	0
TUT	KV35YL	Amenhotep_III	Tiye	2	0
TUT	Tutankhamun	KV55	KV35YL	1	0
TUT	KV21A	0	0	2	0
TUT	Fetus_1	Tutankhamun	KV21A	2	0
TUT	Fetus_2	Tutankhamun	KV21A	2	0
